#!golden 1
#!case cmd_sol
#!section exit
0
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
SOL Commands: info [<channel number>]
              set <parameter> <value> [channel]
              payload <enable|disable|status> [channel] [userid]
              activate [<usesolkeepalive|nokeepalive>] [instance=<number>]
              deactivate [instance=<number>]
              looptest [<loop times> [<loop interval(in ms)> [<instance>]]]
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
